# 07-mcp-servers: Ouvrir l'assistant de configuration MCP

Output mcp-config-demo.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set BorderRadius 8
Set Margin 10
Set MarginFill "#282a36"
Set Framerate 10
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "copilot"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "/mcp config"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 12s

Type " "
Backspace
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
